.DS_Store
node_modules/
# Throwaway headless-verification wrappers (not part of the project): _shot.html, _drive_*.html, etc.
_*.html
# Architecture decision records — kept out of the published repo (headed for the
# project wiki). CONTEXT.md carries the domain model that ships.
docs/adr/
# Impeccable working artifacts (review screenshots are transient; DESIGN.md and
# the design.json sidecar ship).
.impeccable/review/
# Session scratch — handoffs, probe rigs and ticket drafts staged for filing.
# Working notes, deliberately not history. Untracked was not enough: a `git add -A`
# during a history rebuild swept these into a commit, and the reset that followed
# deleted them from disk.
.scratch/
